  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 804.01 Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 804.01 Requirements.\n\n(a) Recyclable materials, as defined in Env-Hw 801.02(b), shall be managed as set forth in Env-Hw 804 unless specifically exempt as specified in Env-Hw 401.03(b)(34) through (38).\n\n(b) Except as set forth in Env-Hw 804.02, a person who manages recyclable materials shall comply with the following requirements:\n\n(1) A generator of recyclable materials shall be subject to Env-Hw 500;\n\n(2) A transporter of recyclable materials shall be subject to Env-Hw 600;\n\n(3) An owner or operator of a facility that stores recyclable materials before they are recycled, including a facility that also recycles the materials, shall be subject to Env-Hw 300 and Env-Hw 700; and\n\n(4) An owner or operator of a facility that recycles recyclable materials without storing the materials before they are recycled shall be subject to the following:\n\na. Notification requirements as set forth in Env-Hw 702;\n\nb. Manifest requirements as set forth in Env-Hw 703; and\n\nc. Biennial reporting requirements as set forth in Env-Hw 705.03.\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; amd by #6384-B, eff 11-26-96; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; amd by #10205, eff 10-19-12; ss by #12350, eff 8-14-17; ss by #12922, eff 11-23-19; ss by #14526, eff 2-28-26, EXPIRES: 2-28-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw800.html"
}
